              <td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.82rem]">zai/glm-5.3</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">1,000,000</td>
              <td class="py-2"><span data-lang="en">Default. Reads a whole repo before it starts.</span><span data-lang="ko">기본값. 저장소 전체를 먼저 읽고 시작할 수 있다.</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-200/50 dark:border-ink-800/60">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.82rem]">zai/glm-5.2</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">1,000,000</td>
              <td class="py-2"><span data-lang="en">Previous generation.</span><span data-lang="ko">이전 세대 주력.</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-ink-200/50 dark:border-ink-800/60">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.82rem]">zai/glm-5-turbo</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">200,000</td>
              <td class="py-2"><span data-lang="en">Cheap bulk work — search, summaries, boilerplate.</span><span data-lang="ko">값싼 대량 작업 — 검색·요약·정형 코드.</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-[0.82rem]">zai/glm-4.7</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">204,800</td>
