      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
        <span data-lang="en">Switch mid-session with <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">/model</code> (or <kbd class="rounded border border-ink-300 px-1 font-mono text-xs dark:border-ink-700">Ctrl+L</kbd>). <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">glm-5.3</code> maps only three thinking levels — <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">low</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">high</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">max</code> — so <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">max</code> is the top of that scale, not an exotic setting.</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">세션 도중 바꾸려면 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">/model</code>(또는 <kbd class="rounded border border-ink-300 px-1 font-mono text-xs dark:border-ink-700">Ctrl+L</kbd>). <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">glm-5.3</code>은 사고 수준을 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">low</code>·<code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">high</code>·<code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">max</code> 세 단계만 매핑하므로, <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">max</code>는 특별한 값이 아니라 그 척도의 맨 위다.</span>
